The '''1982 AFA World Cup''' was the 15th edition of the [[AFA World Cup]], the quadrennial international men's [[w:association football|association football]] championship contested by the senior national teams of the member associations of the '''[[Adonian Football Association]]''' (AFA). It was held in [[Varkana]] from 7 Jume. .